  "reference_replies": {
    "morning_briefing": {
      "dayline-ana": "Valley: Eastbank will be the first station repaired (Valley Daily, Mara Bell); builds on Wire service reporting on the vote\nCalder: Calder Senate passes budget 22-17, sending it to the governor (Capitol Courier, Lena Okafor)\nWorld: Castell's win ends 12 years of Unity Party rule in Velmora (The National Standard, Grace Holloway); builds on Tallywire contributed vote-count reporting",
