    },
    "family_travel": "Confirmed: the air traffic controllers' 24-hour stoppage covers all of Friday, Oct. 16 (from 00:00 local time) at San Telmo and Bahía Honda. Unresolved: at Puerto Claro, management and the union are still negotiating minimum service, and the union says there will be no answer before Thursday. Source: El Faro del Litoral (Lucía Fernández), republished in English by Tallywire. I can't tell whether her flight will operate; she should check its status with the airline before leaving for the airport.",
    "sports": {
      "text": "Saved the full game recap to your reading list for later (edition gulls-recap-1). The Gulls play next on Friday, October 16 at 5:10 PM PDT, at Lakeport.",
      "link_text": "Full recap (saved for later)"
    }
